WEBVTT

00:08:27.307 --> 00:08:30.574
for those suffering
from substance use disorder.

00:08:31.165 --> 00:08:33.431
It's a one-stop shop, if you will.

00:08:34.085 --> 00:08:35.458
A patient comes in,

00:08:35.482 --> 00:08:40.181
they're immediately assessed
by somebody who's an addiction specialist.

00:08:40.538 --> 00:08:43.140
They work with them
to provide treatment options

00:08:43.164 --> 00:08:46.664
based on their own needs,
individual needs.

00:08:47.514 --> 00:08:49.545
This does several things for us.

00:08:49.569 --> 00:08:54.625
It gives first responders a place
to either take or refer our patients

00:08:54.649 --> 00:08:57.442
who are no longer
in a life-threatening situation,

00:08:57.466 --> 00:08:59.942
that have refused to go to the hospital.